                <pb facs="0637" n="525" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg525"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 24607/2a.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Taft to His
                        Majesty King George V.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The White House</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-05-07"><hi rendition="#italic">May 7,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In renewing to your majesty the condolences of the American Government and people
                    upon the death of His Late Majesty I convey to you the heartiest good wishes for
                    the prosperity of your reign.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. H. Taft.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
